--- !u!114 &765368607
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 765368604}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fd416c319eff016ca8e29c6d18ee61ae, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntroController
  m_Prompts:
  - m_Text: 'You are a Hero.


      You are a brave, valiant Hero.'
    m_SFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9bf6ce7afd549423094d81b1f5472171, type: 3}
  - m_Text: 'For as long as you can remember, you''ve lived in the shadow of the
      Illusionist.


      The Illusionist poisons the minds of everyone around him,
      thrusting them into endless illusions before they inexplicably disappear.


      ....you
      can guess what happened to them.'
    m_SFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9bf6ce7afd549423094d81b1f5472171, type: 3}
  - m_Text: 'You aren''t like the dozens of other Heroes who have come before you.


      You
      have enough determination to break through the trickery and deceit that the
      Illusionist has cast over this land.


      You can avenge all of those who
      have fallen before you.'
    m_SFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9bf6ce7afd549423094d81b1f5472171, type: 3}
  - m_Text: 'You must make it to the Illusionists Tower and destroy him....once and
      for all.


      You know it won''t be easy, there will an incredible number
      of tricks and traps to set you back and keep you at bay.


      Despite this,
      you must find a way to reach him. There is nobody else.'
    m_SFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9bf6ce7afd549423094d81b1f5472171, type: 3}
  - m_Text: 'Without you, the Illusionist will never be vanquished.


      Every
      journey starts with the first step, and for you that means braving the Forest
      -- a seemingly infinite maze of Trees that few people ever make it out of alive.


      You
      step forward.....


      The Illusionist will be no more. You''ll make sure
      of it. '
    m_SFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9bf6ce7afd549423094d81b1f5472171, type: 3}
  m_TypewriterDisplay: {fileID: 765368606}
  m_InputPanel: {fileID: 765368605}
  m_ForestSceneName: Forest
